msgstr ""
"اليومية المستخدمة لصرف هذه التسوية. إذا تُركت فارغة، تُستخدم أول يومية بنك "
"أو نقدية للشركة كما في السابق."

#. module: leaders_marketplace
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:leaders_marketplace.field_res_config_settings__marketplace_commission_invoicing
msgid ""
"Journal: the commission and fees are booked by journal entries. Invoice: "
"approving a settlement issues one tax invoice to the vendor, netted against "
"what the marketplace owes them. Have the accountant validate the account "
"mapping before enabling it in production."
msgstr ""
