"Who carries a service out: the platform itself, and the vendors who chose "
"one of the platform's services. A vendor's offer waits here for approval."
msgstr ""
"من ينفذ الخدمة: المنصة نفسها والموردون الذين اختاروا إحدى خدمات المنصة. عرض "
"المورد ينتظر الموافقة هنا."

#. module: leaders_marketplace
#: code:addons/leaders_marketplace/controllers/portal.py:0
msgid "You already provide this service. Stop it first to change it."
msgstr "أنت تقدم هذه الخدمة بالفعل. أوقفها أولاً لتغييرها."

#. module: leaders_marketplace
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:leaders_marketplace.portal_vendor_provide_services
msgid "You have not offered any of the platform's services yet."
msgstr "لم تعرض تقديم أي خدمة من خدمات المنصة بعد."

#. module: leaders_marketplace
#: model:mail.template,subject:leaders_marketplace.mail_template_vendor_provider_approved
msgid "You now provide {{ object.service_id.name }}"
msgstr "أصبحت تقدّم {{ object.service_id.name }}"

#. module: leaders_marketplace
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:leaders_marketplace.portal_vendor_provide_services
msgid ""
"You sell under the platform's name, so you are not listed by name on the "
"providers page. The requests of your services still come to the platform."
msgstr ""
"أنت تبيع باسم المنصة، فلا يظهر اسمك في صفحة مقدمي الخدمة. وتبقى طلبات خدماتك"
" تصل إلى المنصة."

#. module: leaders_marketplace
#: model:mail.template,subject:leaders_marketplace.mail_template_vendor_provider_rejected
msgid "Your offer to provide {{ object.service_id.name }} was refused"
msgstr "تم رفض عرضك لتقديم {{ object.service_id.name }}"

#. module: leaders_marketplace
#: code:addons/leaders_marketplace/controllers/portal.py:0
msgid "Your offer was sent for approval."
msgstr "تم إرسال عرضك للموافقة."

